Mbed TLS 3.6.7 (upstream library, dual Apache-2.0 OR GPL-2.0-or-later).
Source: https://github.com/Mbed-TLS/mbedtls/tree/mbedtls-3.6.7
License: see LICENSE in this directory.

Vendored upstream library sources are not a GRUB TLS implementation. The
GRUB transport, its public API and language-neutral bindings are maintained
separately in grub-core/net/tls.c and include/grub/tls.h.

Only the client TLS 1.2 modules enumerated in Makefile.core.def are linked.
No system libc, shared library, Lua runtime or TLS certificate bypass is used.
